  "goodToKnow": "Die Staffel is a season of a TV series: Ich schaue gerade die zweite Staffel. An episode is eine Folge. In sport, die Staffel is a relay team, and der Staffellauf a relay race. The football season, however, is die Saison. Die Staffelung is a gradation or scale, as in gestaffelte Preise (tiered prices). The word goes back to an old word for a step or rung: Staffel is related to English staple and stave."
